<div id="docusaurus-base-url-issue-banner-container"></div><div><div><a href="#" class="skipToContent_OuoZ">Skip to main content</a></div><div class="main-wrapper"><main><section class="home-features"><div class="container home-container"><div class="home-bg-head" style="transform:translateY(calc(100px - 100px)) translateZ(0px);opacity:1"><div class="video-container"><video class="bg-video active" style="opacity:1" muted="" playsinline="" preload="auto" poster="https://joycode.s3.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/JoyCodeIDE-官网/视频/video-load-1.webp"><source src="https://joycode.s3.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/JoyCodeIDE-官网/home/home-bg-video.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video><video class="bg-video transition" style="opacity:0" muted="" playsinline="" preload="metadata"><source src="https://joycode.s3.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/JoyCodeIDE-官网/home/home-bg-video.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></div></div><div class="home-nav"><div class="home-nav-content"><a class="home-nav-logo" href="/"><img src="/img/logo_white.svg" alt=""></a><div class="home-nav-link"><a class="home-nav-item active" href="/">功能</a><a class="home-nav-item" href="/case">案例</a><a class="home-nav-item" href="/docs/start/getting-started" target="_blank">文档</a><a class="home-nav-item" href="/pricing">定价</a></div><div class="home-nav-right"><a class="home-nav-btn" clstag="QuickDownload">下载 IDE</a><div class="home-nav-user-wrap home-nav-user-wrap--hover home-nav-user-wrap--login"><div class="login-page-nav-user" style="position:relative;display:inline-block" clstag="user-nav-avatar"><div class="head-user-box drank" style="width:auto;height:34px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.5);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);font-size:14px;padding-right:16px;padding-left:16px" clstag="user-nav-login">登录</div></div></div></div><div class="mobile-nav-actions"><a class="mobile-nav-login-btn" href="/login/">登录</a><div class="mobile-nav-menu"><svg t="1751538955986" class="icon" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" version="1.1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" p-id="4780" width="20" height="20"><path d="M960 872H64v-80h896v80zM960 552H64v-80h896v80zM960 232H64v-80h896v80z" fill="#ffffff" p-id="4781"></path></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="home-title-box" style="transform:scale(1);opacity:1;display:block;transition:all 0.3s ease-out;transform-origin:center center"><div class="fadeY"><div class="home-title">代码洪流 一念即<span class="gradient-pink">成</span></div><div class="home-title-desc" style="font-size:22px;margin-top:0">JoyCode，专为应对企业级复杂任务而设计的智能编码工具</div></div><div style="text-align:center" class="fadeY"><a class="home-ide-btn" clstag="freeDownload">免费下载 JoyCode</a><div class="home-ide-btn-other"><a clstag="otherIDEVersion" href="/download/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">其他 IDE 版本下载</a></div></div></div><div class="home-video-box content-p64"><div class="video-box"><video loop="" autoplay="" muted="" playsinline="" webkit-playsinline="true" x5-playsinline="true" x5-video-player-type="h5-page"><source src="https://joycode.s3.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/JoyCodeIDE-官网/homeVideo.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></div></div><div class="home-content-box agent-bg-box"><div class="home-box-name home-box-name-position fadeY">助您驾驭企业复杂的业务场景</div><div class="home-box-desc home-box-name-position fadeY">上下文引擎重磅升级，实现对代码仓库的深度解析与理解。规约编程助力业务需求精准理解，保障交付效果。</div><div class="home-build-box home-agent-content-box"><div class="content-box"><div class="content-box-li" style="opacity:1;transition:all 0.8s ease-out"><div class="fadeY"><div class="home-box-tag">AI Intelligence</div><div class="title"><span>上下文引擎重磅升级实现对代码仓库的深度解析</span></div></div><div class="list fadeY"><span>全面理解代码仓库上下文等集成开发环境信息，根据用户意图智能路由检索策略，让隐含信息无所遁形，助力生产提效。</span></div></div><div class="content-box-li" style="opacity:0;transition:all 0.8s ease-out"><div class="fadeY"><div class="home-box-tag">Multiple Agents</div><div class="title"><span>规约编程助力业务需求精准理解</span></div></div><div class="list fadeY"><span>规约编程实现了从需求到交付的端到端覆盖，确保业务意图精准落地为高质量代码，显著降低开发过程中的信息偏差。</span></div></div><div class="content-box-li" style="opacity:0;transition:all 0.8s ease-out"><div class="fadeY"><div class="home-box-tag">MCP Ecosystem</div><div class="title"><span>开放AI资源生态 <br></span><span> 无缝集成扩展</span></div></div><div class="list fadeY"><span>深度融合京东云JoyAgent智能体资源生态，支持自定义规则、MCP协议扩展与多源AI资源引用，打造更懂企业代码的智能开发环境。</span></div></div></div><div class="img-box"><div class="agent-box-bg"></div><div class="content-box-scroll"><span class="m-step m-step1"></span><span class="step1"></span><span class="step1"></span><span class="step1"></span></div><div class="img-video-box video-radius"><video autoplay="" muted="" playsinline="" webkit-playsinline="true" x5-playsinline="true" x5-video-player-type="h5-page" loop="" preload="auto"><source src="https://joycode.s3.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/JoyCodeIDE-官网/functions/functions-CSR.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></div></div></div></div><div class="home-content-box build-box-bg"><div class="home-box-name fadeY">一键云端部署 <span style="white-space:nowrap">打通研发 - 发布闭环</span></div><div class="home-box-desc fadeY">支持远程项目创建与自动化环境配置，全面打通从开发到发布的全流程通道，极大提升项目交付速度与敏捷性。</div><div class="home-build-box"><div class="img-box"><div class="img-video-box video-radius"><video autoplay="" muted="" playsinline="" webkit-playsinline="true" x5-playsinline="true" x5-video-player-type="h5-page" loop="" preload="auto"><source src="https://joycode.s3.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/JoyCodeIDE-官网/functions/functions-一键部署.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></div><div class="home-build-box-bg"></div></div><div class="content-box fadeY"><div><div class="home-box-tag red-tag">Cloud Services</div><div class="title">云端开发 云端部署</div></div><ul class="list fadeY"><li>环境配置云端托管</li><li>一键部署快速生效</li><li>云端数据安全隔离</li><li>即时共享高效协作</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="home-content-box content-p64 home-content-user-box" style="margin-top:-36px;padding-top:0;display:none;opacity:0"><div class="home-box-name fadeY">工程师最信赖的 AI 伙伴</div><div class="home-user-box-wrapper"><div class="home-user-box mobile-carousel" style="transform:none;transition:none"><div class="carousel-page"><div class="home-user-box-li"><div class="home-user-box-li-content"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="用户头像" loading="lazy"><div class="home-user-box-li-desc">技术校招生</div><div class="home-user-box-li-remark">JoyCode 让 AI 写代码改 BUG 零门槛，帮你理解复杂逻辑，快速掌握代码库，犹如24小时私人技术导师，助新手快速成长提升效率！</div></div></div><div class="home-user-box-li"><div class="home-user-box-li-content"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="用户头像" loading="lazy"><div class="home-user-box-li-desc">财务研发负责人</div><div class="home-user-box-li-remark">JoyCode 助力团队协作，统一代码风格，提升审查效率，帮助新手快速上手，全面提升开发质量与速度，是技术团队的高效助手。</div></div></div></div><div class="carousel-page"><div class="home-user-box-li"><div class="home-user-box-li-content"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="用户头像" loading="lazy"><div class="home-user-box-li-desc">质量效能负责人</div><div class="home-user-box-li-remark">JoyCode 让测试流程更简单高效，快速生成测试用例，精准定位问题，有效促进开发与测试团队协作，全面提升软件工程质量。</div></div></div><div class="home-user-box-li"><div class="home-user-box-li-content"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="用户头像" loading="lazy"><div class="home-user-box-li-desc">10年资深开发者</div><div class="home-user-box-li-remark">JoyCode 代码助手精准高效，快速检查语法、优化代码，深度理解业务逻辑并提供专业建议，显著提升开发效率，助程序员如虎添翼。</div></div></div></div><div class="carousel-page"><div class="home-user-box-li"><div class="home-user-box-li-content"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="用户头像" loading="lazy"><div class="home-user-box-li-desc">职能系统研发负责人</div><div class="home-user-box-li-remark">JoyCode 的智能编码和全场景代码生成能力，直接打通了开发瓶颈，让团队在复杂项目中也能保持行云流水般的编码节奏。</div></div></div><div class="home-user-box-li"><div class="home-user-box-li-content"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="用户头像" loading="lazy"><div class="home-user-box-li-desc">B端系统研发负责人</div><div class="home-user-box-li-remark">JoyCode 统一了团队的代码规范和 AI 协作流程，从需求拆解到质量把控，效率提升肉眼可见，技术管理成本直线下降。</div></div></div></div><div class="carousel-page"><div class="home-user-box-li"><div class="home-user-box-li-content"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="用户头像" loading="lazy"><div class="home-user-box-li-desc">技术校招生</div><div class="home-user-box-li-remark">JoyCode 让 AI 写代码改 BUG 零门槛，帮你理解复杂逻辑，快速掌握代码库，犹如24小时私人技术导师，助新手快速成长提升效率！</div></div></div><div class="home-user-box-li"><div class="home-user-box-li-content"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="用户头像" loading="lazy"><div class="home-user-box-li-desc">财务研发负责人</div><div class="home-user-box-li-remark">JoyCode 助力团队协作，统一代码风格，提升审查效率，帮助新手快速上手，全面提升开发质量与速度，是技术团队的高效助手。</div></div></div></div><div class="carousel-page"><div class="home-user-box-li"><div class="home-user-box-li-content"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="用户头像" loading="lazy"><div class="home-user-box-li-desc">质量效能负责人</div><div class="home-user-box-li-remark">JoyCode 让测试流程更简单高效，快速生成测试用例，精准定位问题，有效促进开发与测试团队协作，全面提升软件工程质量。</div></div></div><div class="home-user-box-li"><div class="home-user-box-li-content"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="用户头像" loading="lazy"><div class="home-user-box-li-desc">10年资深开发者</div><div class="home-user-box-li-remark">JoyCode 代码助手精准高效，快速检查语法、优化代码，深度理解业务逻辑并提供专业建议，显著提升开发效率，助程序员如虎添翼。</div></div></div></div></div><div class="carousel-dots"><span class="carousel-dot active"><i></i></span><span class="carousel-dot"><i></i></span><span class="carousel-dot"><i></i></span></div></div></div><div class="home-content-box2 fadeY" style="padding-top:0"><div class="home-box-name">开始使用 JoyCode</div><div class="home-content-box2-btn" style="margin-bottom:-2px;text-align:center"><div class="home-btn-enterprise-btn-box"><a clstag="companyConsultation" class="home-btn-enterprise-btn" href="https://get.jd.com/#/survey/index?id=8846049463128432" target="_blank">企业咨询</a></div><div class="home-ide-btn-box"><a class="home-ide-btn" clstag="pageBottomDownload"><img src="/img/download/windowslogo.svg" alt="Windows" class="os-logo">免费下载</a></div></div></div></div><div class="breathing-blur-bg"></div></section></main></div><footer class="footers"><div class="footers-box"><div class="footers-a-box"><div class="title">核心产品</div><div class="box"><a href="/docs/start/getting-started" target="_blank"><div class="li">快速入门</div></a><a href="/docs/functions/functions/mcp" target="_blank"><div class="li">功能说明</div></a></div></div><div class="footers-a-box"><div class="title">技术支持</div><div class="box"><a href="/case" target="_blank"><div class="li">实践案例</div></a><a href="/docs/changelog" target="_blank"><div class="li" clstag="homepage-footer-changelog">更新日志</div></a></div></div><div class="footers-a-box"><div class="title">更多推荐</div><div class="box"><a href="https://www.jdcloud.com" target="_blank"><div class="li">京东云官网</div></a><a href="https://www.jdcloud.com/cn/products/agents" target="_blank"><div class="li">JoyAgent</div></a></div></div><div class="footer-jdcloud-info"><div class="footer-jdcloud-info-tel"><a href="https://www.jdcloud.com/" clstag="footerLOGO" class="jdc-footer-logo" target="_blank"><img src="//img1.jcloudcs.com/portal/jdcloud-logo-white-2021.svg" width="150" height="50" alt="京东云" loading="lazy"></a><div class="jdc-footer-consultation consultation-hotline"><p><span>售前：</span>400-098-8505转1</p><p><span>售后：</span>400-098-8505转2</p></div><a href="mailto:org.joycode1@jd.com" clstag="ConsultationMail" class="jdc-footer-consultation consultation-mail"><p><span>邮箱：</span>org.joycode1@jd.com</p></a></div><div class="jdc-footer-channel-item"><div class="jdc-qrcode-wrap"><div class="jdc-qrcode hidden-xs"><div class="row2"><div class="col-6"><div class="qrcode-img-wrap"><img width="100" src="//joycode.s3.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/JoyCodeIDE-官网/qywx.png" alt="扫一扫" class="jdc-qrcode-image" loading="lazy"><p style="margin-left:-4px">扫码加入交流群</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></footer></div></div>
